# Installed features are server-side source, like app/: a feature's runtime
# class, its workbench panel, its install unit - manifests, mail and page
# templates, text files. Nothing in here is ever requested by a browser; a
# feature's browser-facing assets are read off disk and bundled into
# public/.cache/ or _admin/.cache/ like everything else (see
# \Nino\Modules\Assets and \Nino\Admin\Admin::init()).
Require all denied

Options -Indexes
